主图末尾追加两个节点 (real_navigation, food_recommend),仅对 Top-3 跑,
单次规划新增 Amap 调用 10-18 次,候选阶段保持 MockCommute 不变。

== 真实路径导航 ==
- 实现 AmapCommute._call_amap,接入高德 direction 三个 API:
  * /v3/direction/walking
  * /v3/direction/driving
  * /v3/direction/transit/integrated (city_code=021)
- 解析路网 steps (instruction/distance/duration/polyline/road/action),
  公交模式额外拆 transit_segments (walking + bus 段,bus 段含线路名/起讫站/经停)
- MockCommute 也补了简化 mock steps,降级时前端不会拿到空 navigation
- RouteStop 新增 lat/lng/navigation_to_next,Route 新增 navigation_enriched/navigation_source

== 餐厅推荐 ==
- 新 providers/places.py:AmapPlaces + MockPlaces 双实现,自动降级
- 新 data/mock_restaurants.json:149 家虹口区餐厅,15 个菜系(本帮/川/粤/湘/东北/日/韩/西/东南亚/快餐/面食/咖啡/轻食/清真/素食)
- 新 algorithm/food_recommend.py:
  * 锚点:步行/公交看用户那时刻在哪 POI;驾车取段中点
  * 硬过滤:预算 × 1.5、健康禁忌(海鲜/清真/素食)、营业状态、disliked_pois
  * 软加权:rating × 0.40 + 距离衰减 × 0.25 + 价格匹配 × 0.20 + loved_cuisines × 0.15
  * 按菜系分桶,每桶 Top 3,桶之间 matched_loved 优先

== Mock 取号 / 预订(为沉浸模式预留实时提醒字段)==
- 新 providers/booking_mock.py:JSON 文件持久化,线程锁
- 取号:queue_position 自动按 0.5 桌/分钟衰减,剩 2 桌内或 5 分钟内输出
  ready_to_call='approaching',叫到号输出 ready_to_call=true
- 预订:rating >= 4.7 进 pending_restaurant_confirm,10 分钟自动 confirmed
- 反馈字段:remind_at(提前 30 分钟)、arrive_window_start/end(±15 分钟容差)
- 接入点:GET /bookings/user/{user_id} 一次拿走该用户全部活跃订单

== API 端点 (main.py +8) ==
GET    /restaurants
GET    /restaurants/{rid}/queue
POST   /booking/queue
GET    /booking/queue/{ticket_no}
DELETE /booking/queue/{ticket_no}
POST   /booking/queue/{ticket_no}/seat
POST   /booking/reservation
GET    /booking/reservation/{rid}
DELETE /booking/reservation/{rid}
GET    /bookings/user/{user_id}

== 测试 ==
demo.py --book 端到端跑通:
- Top-2 路线 mock 导航 + 餐厅分桶 Top 3
- 取号 Q003-015 → 5 分钟后 ready_to_call=approaching
- 预订 4.7 星店 → pending_restaurant_confirm,所有沉浸模式字段齐全

